abstract: >-
  Deterministic reproducibility code for a regional gravitational phase framework
  for dark-sector phenomenology, including regional matter-geometry selectors,
  basin hierarchy and interface dynamics, geometric active-charge calculations,
  SPARC diagnostics, a static 3D watershed obstruction test, and a history-dependent
  Zel'dovich Lagrangian-basin stress test.
